  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION checkInclusion(s1, s2):\n    IF LENGTH(s1) > LENGTH(s2) THEN RETURN False\n    c1 = FREQ_MAP(s1), c2 = EMPTY_MAP(), l = 0\n    FOR r FROM 0 TO LENGTH(s2) - 1 DO:\n        c2[s2[r]] = c2[s2[r]] + 1\n        IF (r - l + 1) == LENGTH(s1) THEN:\n            IF c1 == c2 THEN RETURN True\n            c2[s2[l]] = c2[s2[l]] - 1\n            IF c2[s2[l]] == 0 THEN DELETE c2[s2[l]]\n            l = l + 1\n        END IF\n    END FOR\n    RETURN False\nEND FUNCTION",
